- Prospective enrollment? Yes, "prospective cohort study"                                                               
- Without previous diagnostic testing, co-infections or complications? Not explicitly stated, but attendees at sexual   
health clinics                                                                                                          
- Consecutive or random sampling? Not explicitly stated, but "attending either of the two sites" suggests consecutive   
enrollment                                                                                                              
- All participants received index test and reference standard? It says "Compared with polymerase chain reaction assay,  
the resolved sensitivity, specificity..." suggesting all participants got both tests                                    
- Presents 2x2 data? Yes, sensitivity, specificity, PPV, NPV reported                                                   
- Case-control? No, it's prospective cohort                                                                             
                                                                                                                        
Decision: INCLUDE                                                                                                       
