Does it meet criteria?                                                                                                  
- Diagnostic accuracy study? Yes, evaluating performance of home test vs NAAT                                           
- Population: women (231 eligible women) attending SHC or OB-GYN Clinic - reproductive age                              
- Prospective enrollment? It says "were recruited to an evaluation" - suggests prospective enrollment                   
- Without previous diagnostic testing, co-infections or complications? Not explicitly stated                            
