Rationale: This is a mathematical modeling study estimating required sensitivity of POC tests, not a diagnostic accuracy
study reporting 2x2 data from an actual test evaluation.                                                                
                                                                                                                        
Study 2: Meta-epidemiological study on publication bias, not primary diagnostic accuracy study. EXCLUDE.                
